      <section id="sec_d65e7">
         <p>This section describes the parameter used to assess the battery status of the SMS.</p>
         <p>Each record contains operational details captured on the specified timestamp.</p>
         <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Operations Parameters</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>Parameter</b>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <b>Description</b>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>batteryStatus</codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>Battery status, g for full, y for medium, r for low.</entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
         <p>For more information on API refer to the ADI OtoSense™ SMS REST API.</p>
